# Each guild owns its folder and reviews PRs that touch it.
# Later lines win, so the catch-all comes first and guild lines follow.
#
# To add a guild:
#   1. Create the GitHub team @Agentic-ED/<guild>-guild
#   2. Create the folder <guild>/ with a README.md
#   3. Add a line:  /<guild>/  @Agentic-ED/<guild>-guild
# The "Validate skills" check fails if a guild folder has no line here.

# Repo-wide default (maintainers) — replace with @Agentic-ED/maintainers once that team exists
*                       @sethluersen

